{{PageBanner|Clb l 021 1 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular arcade game known as '''PAC-MAN''' (パックマン, ''Pakkuman'', '''Pac-Man''') was originally held from July 6th, 2026 to July 21st, 2026. The collaboration includes an exclusive Event Gacha, stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period.<br>
The game is published by [[wikipedia:Namco|Namco]].

==Event Information==
The Battle Cats & "PAC-MAN" collab event!<br>
On from:<br>
{{Color|#B45F06|'''November 26 (11:00 AM) until December 11, 2026 (10:59 AM)!'''}}

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Limited Special unit PAC-MAN on sale!'''}}<br>
Limited Special unit PAC-MAN is now available!<br>
Activate the {{Color|#FF9900|'''powerful CatCombo "PAC-MAN Fever"'''}} with only a single unit!<br>
PAC-MAN grants your army the "Resistant" Effect Up (Sm) effect!<br>
This hero is only available during the collab event from this limited sale pack including bonus items!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> This unit can only be purchased once during the sale period.

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Collab stages come to The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Limited collab stages that recreate the thrill of authentic "PAC-MAN" gameplay!<br>
Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages during this event to test your Cats in these limited maps!

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・"PAC-MAN" collab stages!'''}}<br>
Enemies from The Battle Cats get a "PAC-MAN" glow-up!<br>
Clear a stage, and you might get a chance to challenge a Bonus Stage after!

Rewards:<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Power Pellet'''}}

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Starting Day 5 of the collab: "PAC-MAN & Cat"!'''}}<br>
Beat back a relentless swarm of enemies!

Rewards:<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Power Pellet,'''}} and more!

On from:<br>
{{Color|#B45F06|'''November 30 (11:00 AM) until December 11, 2026 (10:59 AM)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Starting Day 8 of the collab: "Giant PAC-MAN Strikes"!'''}}<br>
A giant PAC-MAN appears with an appetite for Cats!

Rewards:<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Catseye (EX, Rare, Super Rare, Uber Rare, Legend),'''}} and more!

On from:<br>
{{Color|#B45F06|'''December 3 (11:00 AM) until December 11, 2026 (10:59 AM)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Spend a Catamin A during the cooldown period to skip the waiting time and challenge the stage immediately.

{{Color|#B45F06|'''・Limited Collab Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Visit the Cat Base now to try your luck at the {{Color|#FF9900|'''limited "PAC-MAN" Event Capsules'''}}!

Featured units include Special heroes {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Blinky Cat'''}} and {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Inky Cat'''}}!<br>
Other possible rewards include XP and battle items!<br>
Collect Power Pellets for a chance to earn limited collab units!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> The Event Capsules can only be used with campaign-specific Event Tickets earned in-game.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Event Capsules will be unavailable after the event ends and Event Tickets will be unusable.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Unused Event Tickets cannot be converted into items or XP.

{{Color|#B45F06|'''●Limited Missions and Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Earn even more rewards from Limited Missions and Login Stamps!

{{Color|#1155CC|'''"PAC-MAN" Special Missions'''}}<br>
Rewards:<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Leadership'''}}

{{Color|#1155CC|'''Earn up to 15 "PAC-MAN" Collab Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Rewards:<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Power Pellet'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> If Mission clear rewards are not collected before the event ends, they will be lost.

